error[E1001]: `p.0.n` is used here after its value moved away
 --> mem:///main.lu:6:13
  |
4 |     let (x, _) = p
  |          - `p.0` moved here
5 |     let b = p.1.n
6 |     let c = p.0.n
  |             ^^^^^ used after the move
